{"seq":3,"slug":"compliance-audit-trail","title":"合规与审计追踪：用 Git 历史构建可验证的变更证明链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gitops-declarative-delivery/operations/compliance-audit-trail","wordCount":1344,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"合规与审计追踪-用-git-历史构建可验证的变更证明链\">合规与审计追踪：用 Git 历史构建可验证的变更证明链</h1><p>合规（Compliance）是企业级软件系统的刚性需求。SOC 2 Type II 要求变更管理控制；PCI-DSS 要求记录所有对持卡人数据环境的变更；ISO 27001 要求变更审批和操作日志。传统系统需要维护独立的变更管理工具（JIRA、ServiceNow）来记录&quot;谁在什么时候做了什么&quot;——GitOps 将这个记录系统与实际的交付系统合二为一：<strong>Git 历史本身就是完整的、不可篡改的变更审计日志</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>审计追踪（Audit Trail）</td>\n<td>记录系统变更的完整历史，包含变更人、时间、内容和审批信息，用于合规证明和事后调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Branch Protection Rules</td>\n<td>Git 平台对特定分支的强制保护配置，要求 PR 审批、状态检查通过、防止强制推送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CODEOWNERS</td>\n<td>文件，定义 Git 仓库中每个目录的变更必须由哪些用户或团队审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Commit 签名（GPG/SSH）</td>\n<td>为 Git commit 附加密码学签名，证明提交者持有对应私钥，防止身份伪造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SOC 2</td>\n<td>由 AICPA 制定的服务组织控制标准，CC8.1 要求变更管理控制，CC7.1 要求系统运营监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PCI-DSS</td>\n<td>支付卡行业数据安全标准，要求对持卡人数据环境的所有变更进行记录和审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kubernetes Audit Log</td>\n<td>Kubernetes API Server 记录的所有 API 请求日志，包含操作者、时间、资源和请求体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"git-作为审计日志的技术基础\">Git 作为审计日志的技术基础</h2><p>Git 的内容寻址存储（Content-Addressable Storage）和 DAG（有向无环图）结构提供了审计所需的技术保证：</p>\n<h3 id=\"不可变历史\">不可变历史</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Git 的 SHA-1/SHA-256 哈希确保历史不可篡改&#10;# 每个 commit 的 SHA 取决于：&#10;# - 父 commit 的 SHA&#10;# - 作者、时间戳、消息&#10;# - 文件内容的 Merkle tree hash&#10;# 改变任何一个字节，SHA 就会改变，从而使后续所有 commit 的 SHA 失效&#10;&#10;# 查看 commit 的完整信息&#10;git cat-file -p 3f7a2c1&#10;# tree 8e4b2d3...&#10;# parent 2a1f3d8...&#10;# author Alice &lt;alice@example.com&gt; 1718459381 +0800&#10;# committer Alice &lt;alice@example.com&gt; 1718459381 +0800&#10;#&#10;# feat: upgrade payment-service to v2.1.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Git 的 SHA-1/SHA-256 哈希确保历史不可篡改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每个 commit 的 SHA 取决于：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - 父 commit 的 SHA</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - 作者、时间戳、消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - 文件内容的 Merkle tree hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 改变任何一个字节，SHA 就会改变，从而使后续所有 commit 的 SHA 失效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看 commit 的完整信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cat-file</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 3f7a2c1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># tree 8e4b2d3...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># parent 2a1f3d8...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># author Alice &#x3C;alice@example.com> 1718459381 +0800</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># committer Alice &#x3C;alice@example.com> 1718459381 +0800</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># feat: upgrade payment-service to v2.1.0</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这意味着：如果有人试图篡改历史（如删除某条 commit 记录），整个 commit 链的 SHA 都会改变，其他持有该仓库副本的系统（CI/CD、其他开发者的本地仓库）会立即检测到不一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"完整的变更元数据\">完整的变更元数据</h3><p>标准 git commit 包含合规审计所需的所有字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>审计需求</th>\n<th>Git 字段</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>谁做了变更</td>\n<td>author name + email</td>\n<td>Alice <a href=\"mailto:alice@example.com\">alice@example.com</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>什么时候</td>\n<td>author timestamp（含时区）</td>\n<td>2026-06-15T14:23:01+08:00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更了什么</td>\n<td>diff（文件内容差异）</td>\n<td>deployment.yaml: replicas 5→10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>为什么变更</td>\n<td>commit message</td>\n<td>fix: emergency scale during incident</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谁审批了</td>\n<td>PR merge commit（包含 merger 信息）</td>\n<td>Merged by Bob</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批时间</td>\n<td>merge commit timestamp</td>\n<td>2026-06-15T14:25:00+08:00</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"构建合规审计证明链\">构建合规审计证明链</h2><h3 id=\"pr-mr-强制审批作为变更控制\">PR/MR 强制审批作为变更控制</h3><p>合规框架要求变更在应用到生产前必须经过审批。GitHub/GitLab 的 Branch Protection Rules 将这个要求代码化：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[开发者提交 PR] --&gt; B[自动化检查&lt;br/&gt;manifest 验证 + 安全扫描]&#10;    B --&gt; C{检查通过?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[PR 被阻断,通知作者修复]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[等待 CODEOWNERS 审批&lt;br/&gt;至少 2 人 + 对应目录负责人]&#10;    E --&gt; F[PR 合并到 main]&#10;    F --&gt; G[GitOps 调谐器自动同步到集群]&#10;    G --&gt; H[Git commit + merge 记录&lt;br/&gt;形成完整审计追踪]\">graph TD\n    A[开发者提交 PR] --&gt; B[自动化检查&lt;br/&gt;manifest 验证 + 安全扫描]\n    B --&gt; C{检查通过?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[PR 被阻断,通知作者修复]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[等待 CODEOWNERS 审批&lt;br/&gt;至少 2 人 + 对应目录负责人]\n    E --&gt; F[PR 合并到 main]\n    F --&gt; G[GitOps 调谐器自动同步到集群]\n    G --&gt; H[Git commit + merge 记录&lt;br/&gt;形成完整审计追踪]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Branch Protection Rules（通过 Terraform 管理，以便审计）&#10;# terraform/github/main.tf&#10;resource &quot;github_branch_protection&quot; &quot;main&quot; {&#10;  repository_id = github_repository.fleet_infra.node_id&#10;  pattern       = &quot;main&quot;&#10;&#10;  # 要求 PR 审批&#10;  required_pull_request_reviews {&#10;    required_approving_review_count = 2    # 至少 2 人审批&#10;    dismiss_stale_reviews             = true  # push 后清除旧审批&#10;    require_code_owner_reviews        = true  # 必须包含 CODEOWNERS 指定的人&#10;    require_last_push_approval        = true  # 最后一次 push 后也需要审批&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  # 要求状态检查通过&#10;  required_status_checks {&#10;    strict   = true                    # 必须基于最新主分支&#10;    contexts = [&#10;      &quot;ci/validate-manifests&quot;,         # YAML 格式和 schema 验证&#10;      &quot;security/policy-scan&quot;,          # OPA/Kyverno 策略扫描&#10;      &quot;security/secret-scan&quot;,          # 确保没有明文密钥&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  # 阻止强制推送和删除&#10;  allows_force_pushes = false&#10;  allows_deletions    = false&#10;&#10;  # 管理员也必须遵守&#10;  enforce_admins = true&#10;&#10;  # 要求签名 commit&#10;  require_signed_commits = true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Branch Protection Rules（通过 Terraform 管理，以便审计）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># terraform/github/main.tf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">resource \"github_branch_protection\" \"main\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  repository_id = github_repository.fleet_infra.node_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pattern       = \"main\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 要求 PR 审批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  required_pull_request_reviews {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    required_approving_review_count = 2</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 至少 2 人审批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    dismiss_stale_reviews             = true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # push 后清除旧审批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    require_code_owner_reviews        = true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 必须包含 CODEOWNERS 指定的人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    require_last_push_approval        = true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 最后一次 push 后也需要审批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 要求状态检查通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  required_status_checks {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    strict   = true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 必须基于最新主分支</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    contexts = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"ci/validate-manifests\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># YAML 格式和 schema 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"security/policy-scan\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># OPA/Kyverno 策略扫描</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"security/secret-scan\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 确保没有明文密钥</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 阻止强制推送和删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  allows_force_pushes = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  allows_deletions    = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 管理员也必须遵守</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  enforce_admins = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 要求签名 commit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  require_signed_commits = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CODEOWNERS 文件明确每个目录的负责人：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# fleet-infra/CODEOWNERS&#10;# 全局默认：所有变更需要平台团队审批&#10;*                           @example-org/platform-team&#10;&#10;# 生产环境变更额外需要 SRE 和安全团队审批&#10;/apps/*/overlays/production/    @example-org/sre-team @example-org/security-team&#10;&#10;# 基础设施组件变更需要架构师审批&#10;/infrastructure/               @example-org/architects&#10;&#10;# 密钥相关变更需要安全团队&#10;/secrets/                      @example-org/security-team\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># fleet-infra/CODEOWNERS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 全局默认：所有变更需要平台团队审批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*                           @example-org/platform-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 生产环境变更额外需要 SRE 和安全团队审批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/apps/*/overlays/production/    @example-org/sre-team @example-org/security-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 基础设施组件变更需要架构师审批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/infrastructure/               @example-org/architects</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 密钥相关变更需要安全团队</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/secrets/                      @example-org/security-team</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"commit-签名-gpg-ssh\">Commit 签名（GPG/SSH）</h3><p>Commit 签名为审计提供了密码学层面的身份验证——不只是 Git 配置中的 email，而是真实的加密身份证明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 开发者配置 commit 签名&#10;git config --global user.signingkey &quot;ssh-ed25519 AAAA...&quot;&#10;git config --global commit.gpgsign true&#10;git config --global gpg.format ssh&#10;&#10;# 每个 commit 都会附带签名&#10;git log --show-signature&#10;# commit 3f7a2c1&#10;# Good &quot;git&quot; signature for alice@example.com with ED25519 key SHA256:abc123...&#10;# Author: Alice &lt;alice@example.com&gt;&#10;# Date: Mon Jun 15 14:23:01 2026 +0800\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 开发者配置 commit 签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user.signingkey</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ssh-ed25519 AAAA...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit.gpgsign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gpg.format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ssh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每个 commit 都会附带签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --show-signature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># commit 3f7a2c1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Good \"git\" signature for alice@example.com with ED25519 key SHA256:abc123...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Author: Alice &#x3C;alice@example.com></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Date: Mon Jun 15 14:23:01 2026 +0800</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"生产变更的审计报告生成\">生产变更的审计报告生成</h3><p>将 Git 历史转化为合规报告：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;# audit-report.sh：生成指定时间范围内的生产环境变更报告&#10;&#10;START_DATE=&quot;2026-06-01&quot;&#10;END_DATE=&quot;2026-06-30&quot;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;# Production Change Audit Report&quot;&#10;echo &quot;## Period: ${START_DATE} to ${END_DATE}&quot;&#10;echo &quot;&quot;&#10;echo &quot;| Timestamp | Author | Email | Change | Commit |&quot;&#10;echo &quot;|-----------|--------|-------|--------|--------|&quot;&#10;&#10;git log \\&#10;  --after=&quot;${START_DATE}&quot; \\&#10;  --before=&quot;${END_DATE}&quot; \\&#10;  --format=&quot;%ai | %an | %ae | %s | %H&quot; \\&#10;  -- &quot;apps/*/overlays/production/&quot; \\&#10;     &quot;infrastructure/overlays/production/&quot; | \\&#10;while IFS=&#39;|&#39; read -r timestamp author email message sha; do&#10;  echo &quot;| ${timestamp} | ${author} | ${email} | ${message} | ${sha:0:8} |&quot;&#10;done\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># audit-report.sh：生成指定时间范围内的生产环境变更报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">START_DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-06-01\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">END_DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-06-30\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"# Production Change Audit Report\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"## Period: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">START_DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} to ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">END_DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"| Timestamp | Author | Email | Change | Commit |\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"|-----------|--------|-------|--------|--------|\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --after=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">START_DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --before=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">END_DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --format=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"%ai | %an | %ae | %s | %H\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"apps/*/overlays/production/\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">     \"infrastructure/overlays/production/\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> IFS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'|'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> author</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> email</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sha</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"| ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} | ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">author</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} | ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">email</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} | ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">message</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} | ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">8</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} |\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"kubernetes-集群变更的细粒度审计\">Kubernetes 集群变更的细粒度审计</h2><p>Git 记录了期望状态的变更，但审计有时需要&quot;集群中实际执行了什么&quot;的记录。结合 Kubernetes Audit Log 和 Argo CD 事件，构建完整的双层审计：</p>\n<h3 id=\"argo-cd-操作审计\">Argo CD 操作审计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看 Argo CD 的 Application 操作历史&#10;argocd app history payment-service&#10;# ID  DATE                           REVISION&#10;# 1   2026-06-15 14:23:08 +0800      main (3f7a2c1)&#10;# 2   2026-06-10 09:45:30 +0800      main (8b3e91f)&#10;# 3   2026-06-01 16:10:45 +0800      main (2a1f3d8)&#10;&#10;# 查看特定同步的详情&#10;argocd app get payment-service --revision 3f7a2c1&#10;&#10;# Argo CD 在 Kubernetes 事件中记录所有操作&#10;kubectl get events -n argocd | grep payment-service&#10;# LAST SEEN   TYPE    REASON         OBJECT                    MESSAGE&#10;# 14m         Normal  OperationStarted  application/payment-service  Operation initiated&#10;# 14m         Normal  OperationCompleted  application/payment-service  Operation successful\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看 Argo CD 的 Application 操作历史</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ID  DATE                           REVISION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1   2026-06-15 14:23:08 +0800      main (3f7a2c1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2   2026-06-10 09:45:30 +0800      main (8b3e91f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3   2026-06-01 16:10:45 +0800      main (2a1f3d8)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看特定同步的详情</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --revision</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 3f7a2c1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Argo CD 在 Kubernetes 事件中记录所有操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> events</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> argocd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># LAST SEEN   TYPE    REASON         OBJECT                    MESSAGE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 14m         Normal  OperationStarted  application/payment-service  Operation initiated</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 14m         Normal  OperationCompleted  application/payment-service  Operation successful</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"kubernetes-audit-log-配置\">Kubernetes Audit Log 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# /etc/kubernetes/audit-policy.yaml&#10;apiVersion: audit.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: Policy&#10;rules:&#10;  # 记录生产 namespace 中所有资源的写操作&#10;  - level: RequestResponse&#10;    namespaces: [&#39;payment&#39;, &#39;auth&#39;, &#39;api-gateway&#39;]&#10;    verbs: [&#39;create&#39;, &#39;update&#39;, &#39;patch&#39;, &#39;delete&#39;]&#10;    resources:&#10;      - group: &#39;apps&#39;&#10;        resources: [&#39;deployments&#39;, &#39;statefulsets&#39;, &#39;daemonsets&#39;]&#10;      - group: &#39;&#39;&#10;        resources: [&#39;configmaps&#39;, &#39;secrets&#39;, &#39;services&#39;]&#10;&#10;  # 记录 RBAC 变更&#10;  - level: RequestResponse&#10;    resources:&#10;      - group: &#39;rbac.authorization.k8s.io&#39;&#10;        resources: [&#39;rolebindings&#39;, &#39;clusterrolebindings&#39;]&#10;    verbs: [&#39;create&#39;, &#39;update&#39;, &#39;patch&#39;, &#39;delete&#39;]&#10;&#10;  # 其余操作只记录元数据&#10;  - level: Metadata\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># /etc/kubernetes/audit-policy.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"co