"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 打包成审计包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -czf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> audit-package-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +%Y%m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.tar.gz</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  change-history.csv</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pr-approvals.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  branch-protection.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  cluster-state-snapshot.json</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"密钥和访问控制的审计\">密钥和访问控制的审计</h2><p>合规审计还关注&quot;谁有权限做什么&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 导出 Argo CD RBAC 配置&#10;kubectl get configmap argocd-rbac-cm -n argocd -o yaml &gt; rbac-config.yaml&#10;&#10;# 导出所有 AppProject（定义了哪些团队可以访问哪些集群/命名空间）&#10;kubectl get appprojects -n argocd -o yaml &gt; appprojects.yaml&#10;&#10;# 列出所有 Argo CD 用户和权限&#10;argocd account list&#10;&#10;# 查看特定用户的权限&#10;argocd account get --account alice\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 导出 Argo CD RBAC 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> configmap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> argocd-rbac-cm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> argocd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yaml</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rbac-config.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 导出所有 AppProject（定义了哪些团队可以访问哪些集群/命名空间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> appprojects</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> argocd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yaml</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> appprojects.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 列出所有 Argo CD 用户和权限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> account</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看特定用户的权限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> account</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --account</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alice</span></span></code></pre></div><p>GitOps 的访问控制审计比传统方式更清晰：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对集群的写权限 = 对 Git 配置仓库的写权限（可在 Git 平台查看）</li>\n<li>不存在&quot;有人手动修改了集群但没有记录&quot;的情况（GitOps selfHeal 确保）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>GitOps 将&quot;变更管理系统&quot;与&quot;交付系统&quot;合二为一：Git 历史本身就是合规审计所需的变更记录。SHA-256 内容寻址哈希确保历史不可篡改；PR 审批记录了&quot;谁批准了这次变更&quot;；Branch Protection Rules 和 CODEOWNERS 将审批流程从人工规范变成强制执行的技术控制。构建完整的审计证明链需要三层叠加：Git 历史（期望状态变更）、Argo CD 事件（调谐器操作记录）、Kubernetes Audit Log（集群实际执行记录）。合规框架映射表将 SOC 2、PCI-DSS、ISO 27001 的控制要求一一对应到具体的 GitOps 机制，使得向审计师提交证明包成为可自动化的操作，而非依赖人工整理。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>Operations 章节完成。本 hub 覆盖了 GitOps 从原理到大规模运营的完整知识体系。从 <a href=\"../foundations/gitops-principles\">GitOps 四原则</a> 出发，通过工具链的选择和模式的应用，最终实现可审计、可合规、可扩展的声明式交付体系。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合规与审计追踪：用 Git 历史构建可验证的变更证明链","id":"合规与审计追踪-用-git-历史构建可验证的变更证明链"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Git 作为审计日志的技术基础","id":"git-作为审计日志的技术基础"},{"level":3,"text":"不可变历史","id":"不可变历史"},{"level":3,"text":"完整的变更元数据","id":"完整的变更元数据"},{"level":2,"text":"构建合规审计证明链","id":"构建合规审计证明链"},{"level":3,"text":"PR/MR 强制审批作为变更控制","id":"pr-mr-强制审批作为变更控制"},{"level":3,"text":"Commit 签名（GPG/SSH）","id":"commit-签名-gpg-ssh"},{"level":3,"text":"生产变更的审计报告生成","id":"生产变更的审计报告生成"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubernetes 集群变更的细粒度审计","id":"kubernetes-集群变更的细粒度审计"},{"level":3,"text":"Argo CD 操作审计","id":"argo-cd-操作审计"},{"level":3,"text":"Kubernetes Audit Log 配置","id":"kubernetes-audit-log-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"合规框架映射","id":"合规框架映射"},{"level":3,"text":"定期合规证明导出","id":"定期合规证明导出"},{"level":2,"text":"密钥和访问控制的审计","id":"密钥和访问控制的审计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多集群舰队管理：GitOps 在大规模集群环境中的扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gitops-declarative-delivery/operations/multi-cluster-fleet"},"next":null}